\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Concrete ownership tree construction. (a)~Java code with four allocation sites $s_1$--$s_4$. (b)~The instantaneous heap graph $H_t$ at the point inside \texttt  {work()}, showing all five edge types from Section~\ref {sec:semantics}. (c)~The dominator tree $T_t$: $s_1$ is dominated by \text  {GLOBAL}{} (escapes via static field, classified \textbf  {HEAP}{}), while $s_2, s_3$ are dominated by $f_1$ and $s_4$ by $f_2$ (all classified \textbf  {OWN}{}, reclaimable at frame exit).}}{9}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
